  "historyNote": "#4750, eff 1-29-90; ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95 (formerly Saf-C 408.061), EXPIRED: 3-24-03 New. #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03 New. #8093, EMERGENCY, eff 5-28-04, EXPIRES: 11-24-04; ss by #8172, eff 9-21-04; ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
